- = Exctract all the archives of this serie to the one HD folder = -

Set of source codes for AsmOne Motorolla 680x0 asembler and for AMOS Pro.
Generators of coordinate sets for spheres and variety of polygons and shapes.
Converter of three dimensional sets of polygons into two dimensional vector
graphics.
Players for two dimensional graphics with source codes for Blitter and
asembler.
Laffik's essays on fastest way to find octants, exact drawing lines with
Blitter and finding minterms.
